start     "Chapter 3: The Market"
paragraph "The market opened before dawn. Mara had a list, and the list had a list."
section   "Her list"
paragraph "Bread"
list-item "a rye loaf"
list-item "two rolls"
list-item "Fruit"
list-item "apples"
list-item "pears, if they are ripe"
paragraph "Ask the seller which ones came in today."
list-item "Fish"
list-item "whatever is fresh"
paragraph "She folded the paper twice."
section   "Stalls she skipped"
paragraph "The spice stall"
list-item "The cheese stall, because the queue went round the corner"
paragraph "A different list starts here."
paragraph "The bell rang at seven."
heading 1 "Chapter 3: The Market"
heading 2 "Her list"
heading 3 "Stalls she skipped"
warning: ""
